{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-29 02:04:40 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ReadFileAudit-R2] [Project: read_file_search_audit] Round 2 research initiated after rejection. CORRECTED UNDERSTANDING: User wants to BUILD a new MCP tool (or enhance read_file) to ELIMINATE all shell command usage (grep/sed/rg) by agents. This is not about documentation - it's about creating infrastructure so agents NEVER need shell search commands. Previous research incorrectly recommended policy changes instead of building replacement. | corrected_understanding=build_replacement_tool_not_policy; phase=research_restart; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will analyze: (1) every grep/sed/rg use case, (2) architecture options for new tool, (3) technical implementation approach, (4) integration with existing infrastructure\", \"what\": \"Must research requirements for building new MCP tool to replace grep/sed/rg entirely\", \"why\": \"Previous research failed by recommending policy changes instead of building infrastructure\"}; round=2; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_search_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-29T02:04:40.359396+00:00_4ad6c4a7", "timestamp": "2026-01-29T02:04:40.359435+00:00"}
